## Suggested Educational Milestones for the PoC

   1. Milestone 1 (Lane Keeping): Use traditional, non-AI computer vision algorithms (canny edge detection, hough line transforms, and inverse perspective mapping) to track track boundaries at 30 FPS.
   2. Milestone 2 (Collision Avoidance): Introduce a dedicated YOLOv8n TensorRT thread configured exclusively to detect a mock "stop sign" or leading vehicle object obstacle, calculating an automated emergency braking trigger.

